id=BitPerfect.module
name=BitPerfect Universal Audio Engine
version=v5.7.5-Universal
versionCode=5705
author=Kostyantyn Matviyevskyy aka kostyamat & Antigravity (c)2026
description=QF/K706 (or MG clone) only: UIS7862 full module, UIS8581 reduced profile (factory 16-bit/44.1 kHz kept). On UIS7862 bit-to-bit audio: 24-bit/48 kHz path at 0 dB, volume and effects on the sound processor only. Shared microphone (several recorders at once), navigation ducking with your own navigators, call microphone per channel (level, echo cancelling, noise reduction depth, presets), USB DAC output at full scale with the DAC's own volume following the head unit's knob. Settings app: BitPerfect Control.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kostyamat/BitPerfec-Audio-Qf-module-Magisk/v5.4-repaired/update.json
